  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">02 Nutrition treatment</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Country portfolio budget - CPB Tajikistan 2019-2022 Treat moderate acute malnutrition in children&#xa0;aged 6&#x2011;59&#xa0;months and implement malnutrition prevention activities using social and behaviour change communication with vulnerable groups while building the Government&#x2019;s capacity to manage nutrition programmes.</narrative>
  </description>
